          <p class="vb-intro">Even the founder of homeopathy, Dr. Samuel Hahnemann, recognized: <em>"The mind is the key to healing the patient."</em> Enneagram Homeopathy goes a step deeper – to the unconscious core of the mind, the Enneagram fixation.</p>
